               <problem id="prob-00012">
                  <para id="para-00069">Solve the inequality: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>–</m:mi><m:mn>56</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
