                  <para id="para-00085">Try again. Revisit activity 2.10.5</para>
                  <para id="para-00086">The correct answer is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>
